CURRENT WIRE IS WRONG FOR K2.x: output_config.effort is a K3-only concept (chat reference: reasoning_effort 'Not supported' on k2.6 and k2.7-code). thinking:{type:'adaptive'} is undocumented for Kimi. On kimi-k2.7-code, 'only type=enabled is allowed' makes adaptive a probable 400.
RECOMMENDED WIRE PER LINE (MoonshotAnthropic):
- kimi-k3: keep output_config:{effort:low|high|max} and no thinking field (current Profile row, correct). Note: the Claude Code guide says K3 thinking 'can be turned off' there, which conflicts with the schema. Ignore that until a live check.
